 | PATCH | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | `{"title"?,"status"?,"assignee"?}` → 200 |
 | DELETE | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | → 204 |
 
+| POST | `/orgs/{oid}/users/{uid}/transfer` | `{"toOrgId"}` → 200 `{"id","orgId"}` |
+
+Transfer: only an org admin of `{oid}` may move a user of `{oid}` (non-admin → 403,
+caller in another org or user not in `{oid}` → 404, missing/same/unknown `toOrgId` → 400).
+To keep project members inside the project's org, the move removes the user's
+memberships in the old org's projects (archived ones too), unassigns their tasks
+there, and clears their org-admin flag.
+
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`.
 
 ## Access rules
